<title>POLAND: Polish unemployment falls to 13.2 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Polish unemployment falls to 13.2 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland fell to 13.2 percent of the workforce in October from 13.5 percent in September, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) show.  </p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	OCTOBER    SEPTEMBER    OCT 1995</p>
<p> number of jobless million	2.286	2.341	  2.596</p>
<p> pct of workforce	    13.2	 13.5	   14.7</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
